ARCH_ATK="Basic attack. The bow stays close to her chest and her bow arm stays bent the whole time, never stretched out at arm's length. Within the first third of a second she takes a quick step to the side, turns her hips and bends her knees, raises the bow in front of her chest pointing slightly upward to the side, draws the string back to her chin with an arrow of pale silver-blue moonlight and releases: the string snaps and the arrow flies off slightly upward and leaves the frame quickly. Then she steps back, the glow on the bow fades during a long relaxed recovery and she lowers the bow to the starting pose."
ARCH_SUP="Super skill Moon Volley. The bow stays close to her body and her bow arm stays bent the whole time, never stretched out at arm's length. Within the first second she turns once around on the spot with quick small steps, and as she faces the viewer again she bends her knees and raises the bow in front of her chest pointing slightly upward to the side; silver-blue moonlight runs along the bow, she draws three arrows of moonlight together to her chin and releases: the three arrows fly off slightly upward and leave the frame quickly. Then the moonlight fades and she lowers the bow to the starting pose."
ARCH_HYP="Ultimate skill Hunt of the Giant. The bow stays close to her body and her bow arm stays bent the whole time, never stretched out at arm's length. Within the first second she makes a small jump and lands on one knee on the same spot, raises the bow in front of her chest pointing slightly upward to the side and slowly draws one long thick arrow of bright silver-blue moonlight to her chin, moonlight glowing on her shoulders and hair, no threads or lines of light in the air; she releases and the heavy arrow flies off slightly upward and leaves the frame quickly. Then she stands up and lowers the bow to the starting pose."
for s in ('bt','ti'):
    T[f'artemis_{s}_atk']=ARCH_ATK; T[f'artemis_{s}_sup']=ARCH_SUP; T[f'artemis_{s}_hyp']=ARCH_HYP
P={}
for c,tl in T.items():
    key='_'.join(c.split('_')[:2]); desc,pron,col=D[key]
    P[c]=HEAD+body(desc,pron)+tl+" "+tail(col, c.endswith('_idle'))
json.dump(P,open('/home/claude/kl/b3/p12.json','w'),indent=1)
bad=['burst ','lantern','pirouette','slash','swing ','sweep','feet planted','straight up through']
for c,p in P.items():
    core=p.split('No arc-shaped')[0]; h=[b for b in bad if b in core]
